sequenceDiagram
  participant User as User (Browser)
  participant FE as Frontend (React)
  participant FB as Firebase Auth
  participant BE as Backend (Express)
  participant DB as MongoDB
  participant AI as Gemini API
  participant Stripe as Stripe

  User->>FE: Open app / login
  FE->>FB: Sign in
  FB-->>FE: ID token
  FE->>BE: POST /api/auth/sync (Bearer token)
  BE->>DB: Upsert user by firebaseUid/email
  DB-->>BE: User record
  BE-->>FE: user + credits

  User->>FE: Generate notes
  FE->>BE: POST /api/generate (topic + options)
  BE->>DB: Check credits
  BE->>AI: generateContent(prompt)
  AI-->>BE: JSON string notes
  BE->>DB: Save Note + deduct 1 credit
  BE-->>FE: note + remaining credits

  User->>FE: Buy credits
  FE->>BE: POST /api/checkout/create-checkout-session
  BE->>Stripe: Create Checkout Session
  Stripe-->>BE: session URL
  BE-->>FE: redirect URL
  User->>Stripe: Complete payment
  FE->>BE: POST /api/checkout/verify-session
  BE->>Stripe: Retrieve session/payment
  BE->>DB: Mark transaction completed + add credits (idempotent)
  BE-->>FE: updated credits

